vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WN1REeP-DRAQ7kNvwH1SZLo&_nc_oc=Adl6CcbUHugPchVR6eoPrxFdT_0Ulp4FHy0WjSPHDfx6bnfPkQLuJpzS_a36V7WWPro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyyDHy8cPxFhkCkbu0XO2CKQjXm5qusV_RxxRUacZo2ig&oe=69BAA2D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jqz0pWcqjqgQ7kNvwGj2d39&_nc_oc=AdkZ8ZQQKLYVEmeKpX8NfrM5oUjcQf0-SiW_UHSIDMd7u2e5Oo_e14EedSTSsryg5Nc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxz3vOTBb1dSrMoQ4F76n6xV4N46-LRJVEq25aEmgZm4A&oe=69BAA7B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NQEuSJ5HuYwQ7kNvwFL-buU&_nc_oc=AdnmritXX1tBt04Dh8kvpMymXH2hLIrvh1IfTVcGxx6uGzlHvlEet-MKtLVJuihjJjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyPXwpe7u8ilcm24jWtHctvmP3MSogt8PrxVPt_9kRsOw&oe=69BAB555"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "